  "notes": "A level 200 Runner, paused in the Simulacrum, and no numbers were predicted to Pavel. One dart at a time, in the floor. An explosion counts up to the enemy's body, which is about half a metre out from where the distance is taken to. The dart that did nothing is 4.2 m from the Runner's feet in the screenshot, measured from the lines of the floor, and its body is taken to be 0.4 m nearer, as in T-33. Why the dart in the body showed 80 twice is an open question to Pavel. It agrees with the wiki. Zakti is not in the library yet.",
